        },
        "description": "__Grade:__ 3rd Year\n__Positions:__ Founder, Mascot, and Official Deer of the Deer Club, Part-Time Deer at Hino Zoo.\n\nNoko Shikanoko is a unique human-deer hybrid and the founder and mascot of the Deer Club at Hino Minami High School.\n\nShe is a transfer student who becomes the best friend, classmate, and clubmate of [Torako Koshi](https://anilist.co/character/330137/Torako-Koshi).",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 107961,
