    {
      "role": "SUPPORTING",
      "node": {
        "id": 337286,
        "name": {
          "full": "Kinu Tanukikoji",
          "native": "狸小路絹",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337286-GBB8vLCdBbdu.png"
        },
        "description": "__Grade:__ 2nd Year\n__Position:__ Secretary of the Student Council\n\nKinu Tanukikoji is a student at Hino Minami High School and a complete girlfailure, being extremely timid and overthinking almost everything. Whenever she makes a simple mistake like accidentally getting papers in the wrong order, she mentally spirals and goes into a state of panic, even going as far as coming up with imaginary disastrous events that would (but actually won't) unfold from her minor mistake and attempting to commit seppuku. \n\nKinu is also childhood friends with [Chiharu Tsubameya](https://anilist.co/character/337287/Chiharu-Tsubameya).",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "16-17"
      },
